### Residual risks
- Host default Node is **v24.5.0**; openclaw needs **≥24.15**. Runner prepends `~/.nvm/versions/node/v24.18.0/bin` when present — if that install moves, live runs fail with a clear openclaw version error.
- **support@3** is a weak proxy (hit@3 + non-empty snippet), not semantic entailment.
- Smoke only covered 2 facts; full 15-fact category coverage not re-measured this job.
